usage: ladon result [-h] {validate,resolve,inspect,guide,export,verify} ...

Validate manifests or resolve explicitly supplied evidence without execution.

positional arguments:
  {validate,resolve,inspect,guide,export,verify}
    validate            Check manifest integrity; does not check Lean or
                        correspondence.
    resolve             Bind targets to explicitly supplied local canonical
                        evidence.
    inspect             Inspect supplied result evidence offline without
                        running checks.
    guide               Read attributed explanations and citations alongside
                        stored evidence.
    export              Export explicitly disclosed files into a portable core
                        bundle.
    verify              Verify bundle integrity only; does not replay proofs.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
